      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Hi @{5aef49599026857d34f7d6dc|full_name}! Thanks for providing the avatar ID, after some research it seems the issue might not be in the Personal Mirror but rather on this specific avatar. It seems like the shader for this avatar does not appear to write to alpha which makes it unable to be displayed in cut-out style mirrors. This behavior is also present in world space mirrors, not just personal mirror for this avatar.\nOur suggestion is trying to reupload the avatar with a different shader to view it in cut-out style mirrors, or you could also turn on the environment in your personal mirror to view the avatar in it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
